  "bodyHash": "friRRcFMpFk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔注入器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 添加了一种新的附魔台，让你能精确选择要应用的附魔，而不是依赖随机结果。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基础附魔注入器专为简单附魔设计，而高级附魔注入器则能修改已有附魔、用经验等级修复物品，并从不需要的附魔中回收经验。🔮</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">书架的作用与原版附魔台一样，随着你搭建的附魔设施扩展，可以解锁更强的附魔。📚 成本、可用附魔、宝藏附魔、修复以及其他许多机制都可以完全配置，以符合你喜欢的游戏进程风格。🎛️</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">选择你的附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 精确选择要应用的附魔，而不是依赖随机附魔结果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">书架进程：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在注入器周围搭建附魔设施，以解锁更强的附魔和更高等级。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">两种注入器等级：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用基础注入器进行简单附魔，或升级到高级注入器以获得额外功能和更低成本。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">修改已有装备：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用高级注入器升级、移除和调整已有附魔物品的附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用经验修复：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接用经验等级恢复耐久度，无需消耗修复材料。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">♻️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">回收经验：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 解除不需要的物品附魔并收回经验，类似砂轮。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">也可附魔书：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接通过注入器制作附魔书，打造你的完美图书馆。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扩展附魔选项：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可选择允许通常仅限于铁砧的附魔，例如将锋利附魔应用到斧头上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎛️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自定义成本、书架要求、修复、可用附魔以及更多内容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔描述：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 安装</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-insights\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Enchantment Insights</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，可直接在注入器界面查看附魔描述。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cATWWPwhay4\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可以直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（Fabric 环境下需要安装</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，作者</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">目录下，文件名根据配置类型分别为</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。并非所有配置类型每种模组都存在，甚至可能完全没有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freyadono\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Freyadono</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 创作了原版的</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-plus\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Enchanting Plus</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，多年前我非常喜欢游玩它，并且它极大地启发了本项目。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/releasehun\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> releaseHUN</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 为本模组创作了精美的纹理。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lorddeathunter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> LordDeatHunter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Wraith Waystones</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，部分启发了附魔注入器界面的设计。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shxrkie\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> SHXRKIE</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在开发过程中提供的所有帮助和反馈。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/climate-rivers\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/climaterivers/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mindful-darkness\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mindfuldarkness/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
